# API routes

- Pages Router API: default export `handler(req, res)` with `NextApiRequest` / `NextApiResponse`.
- DB access via `db` from `@/database/drizzle`; types from `@/database/schema`.
- POST bodies are often `JSON.parse(req.body)` — match the route you are editing.
- Multi-step writes: `db.transaction(async (tx) => { ... })`.
- Errors: only some routes return `ApiError` from `@/types`; do not introduce a global wrapper unless asked.
